      "description": "VisA PCB photo: Yang Zou, Jongheon Jeong, Latha Pemula, Dongqing Zhang and Onkar Dabeer, SPot-the-Difference (ECCV 2022). CC BY 4.0: https://registry.opendata.aws/visa/. Resized/letterboxed from bundled PCB2 0000; no defects added. Source and hashes: ../../assets/showcase/SOURCES.md. No robot/controller operation. Timestamp-pairing control fixture: both streams reuse the SAME PCB photograph with artificial 1.000 s and 1.002 s headers. These are not two physical captures or evidence of real camera synchronization. The 3 ms tolerance pairs them using ordered FIFO and retains both original headers/tickets. This is a one-shot fixed-time fixture: Reset flow state before replay, otherwise duplicates are ignored. No ROS installation or network activity is required.",
